~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_detective
	=> first_chat
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_chat
: The first stall is occupied, which isn't weird on any other day
: But it is ominous after a fresh murder
: Something smells fishy about this
: Or rather, kind of shitty

???: HEY!
???: Is someone out there?
???: Can you throw me a new roll? I need some help over here

: Definetly shitty

Roadie: Hey, you know a murder just occoured, right? What are you doing in here?
???: I know that, its why i'm here. I'm the detective on the-
: . . .
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.DISSAPOINTED
Detective: Ouughh- On the case..
Detective: But i'm afraid I made a mistake at lunch today
Detective: I don't think i'll be out anytime tonight

$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.NEUTRAL
Roadie: I'm the pizza guy that was working here tonight before the murder. Roadie.
Detective: Nice to hear you Roadie. Though you may be working overtime tonight, no one gets out of here until we solve this case.
Roadie: So i've heard
Detective: I'm confined to the can for the forseeable future so that will take some time. Some way to spend my last day on the force...
Detective: Hey, kid
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.EXCITED
Detective: I have an offer for you
Roadie: What do you mean offer dude?
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.NEUTRAL
Detective: I'm stuck in here and wont be solving the mystery anytime soon. You flip pizzas right?
Roadie: Pizzas, not burgers
Roadie: But yea
Detective: Whatever, whatever. Listen! I trust a pizza flipper only because pizza will turn any man honest when the pizza's made right
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.DISSAPOINTED
Detective: Everyone else: Scumbags. Liars. Can't trust em.
Detective: Not even your own customers. Unless...
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.EXCITED
Detective: You can make some pizzas and get the truth!

$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.NEUTRAL
Roadie: Listen, i'm not a detective. I just want to get off my shift on time
Detective: That's the offer kid. Solve this and you get to go home

Detective: I need you to resore rightful rigatoni to New Sokyo
Roadie: There is no rigatoni in this town dude
Detective: Even so, you need to take this case
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.DISSAPOINTED
Detective: Your evening depends on it
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.NEUTRAL
$> StoryFlags.met_detective = true
=> END

~ tutorial
Detective: Ok kid, make me a pizza
Roadie: A pizza?
Detective: yea, make me any pizza you fancy, i'm not picky
Roadie: Is that what detectives do?
Detective: It's what you'll do tonight! Pizza makes people honest. Remeber that!
=> END

~ tutorial_pizza
Detective: Perfect kid! I'm not picky but other customers will be. I'll give you all i've got since you brought me my favorite pizza
Detective: I made a bit of an expedition
Roadie: Out of the john?
Detective: Just a stolen moment. But I found this!
: A bucket of bolts slides out from under the stall
Roadie: ... Bolts?
Detective: I have a hunch kid, just roll with me
Detective: Everyone has a favorite topping
Roadie: Like toilet bolts?
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.DISSAPOINTED
Detective: Who would eat a piece of metal kid? I don't know, give it a shot
Roadie: You're the expert...
$> DialogueMoodManager.speaker_mood = DialogueMoodManager.MOOD.NEUTRAL
=> END

~ default_pizza
Detective: Yea, pizza. You could use something like that to get someone to talk. Tell the REAL truth y'know?
Roadie: How about you, feeling honest?
Detective: I've been honest the whole time. Nothing new to say. Make another one for someone else
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Detective: Anything new?
Roadie: I don't think so...
Detective: Well, get out there! You can do it kid
=> END

~ clear_robot
: Roadie fills in The Detective on what he knows and the Robot's story.
Detective: Good start kid! We have a timeline for when Pepperoncini entered his office.
Roadie: But he didn't do it...
Detective: Doesn't seem like it, no! But! We still have evidence to dig into
Detective: He was a bloody mess right? Go check for a weapon or a sign of what the weapon may have been
Detective: You never know what a second look can dig up.
=> END

~ clear_harry
: Roadie fills in The Detective on what he knows and the ordeal surrounding Harry
Detective: Great Mary Joseph! You have a red handed culprit already? You are good at this kid
Roadie: Yea, he admitted to it under very little pressure actually
Detective: Well, if Harry was only an accessory like that he probably wanted to confess from the start
Roadie: Well, we did it right? Caught the bad guy!
Detective: Not quite.
Roadie: Why not?
Detective: You mentioned a bruise, a messy office, and other unexplained evidence right?
Roadie: Yea...
Detective: It's just bad form as a detective to leave clues unexplained
Detective: There may be more to this murder yet...
Detective: Try to uncover this whole bruise deal, get an explanation for that from the perp
=> END

~ clear_clown

=> END

~ clear_holmes
=> END

~ clear_jiles
=> END

~ the_full_story
=> END